  "brief_en": "Read ranking.json and covers/. This is fictional benchmark data, not a real game-sales ranking. Create a 30-second 3D ranking film in which tower height is proportional to copies sold. Visit entries from rank 20 to rank 1 with a smooth camera, showing each name, cover and value. Keep a consistent height scale and give the winner a clear final reveal.",
  "brief_zh": "读取 ranking.json 和 covers/。这是虚构评测数据，不是真实游戏销量榜。制作 30 秒 3D 排行榜，以销量成比例决定塔高。镜头按第 20 名到第 1 名移动，显示名称、封面、数值；高度比例保持一致，结尾清楚揭晓第一名。",
